# Local validation tooling artifacts (see scripts/clean.sh)
node_modules/
.cache/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/

# Tool-specific agent config/state — instructions for AI agents live in .github/ and AGENTS.md
# instead, per AGENTS.md's tool-agnostic framing (this repo isn't Claude-Code-specific).
.claude/

# Go build artifacts (see implementations/reference/). `go build ./...` run from a `main`
# package's own directory (instead of always passing -o) writes a binary named after that
# directory right into it — caught happening for real with examples/go-quickstart while
# verifying sdks/go/testcontainer.
implementations/reference/bin/
implementations/reference/server
implementations/reference/cli
examples/go-quickstart/go-quickstart
*.test
